*Architectural Pillars

Deterministic Risk Core (/src/risk-engine/engine.ts):
Computes weighted manipulation risk scores (0–100) based strictly on mathematical heuristics, velocity ratios, and telemetry flags.
Evaluates transparent policy definitions (e.g., P-CRITICAL-04: Pause and Verify, P-WARN-02: Friction Step-Up, P-ALLOW-01: Standard Dispatch).
Never delegates transaction authorization decisions to unconstrained black-box LLMs.
Grounded AI Explainability (/src/domain/adapters/ai-explanation-service.ts):
Uses server-side Gemini models exclusively for translating structured telemetry facts into plain-language case summaries for analysts and calming explanations for stressed customers.
Strictly bounded by factual evidence payload—prohibits speculative assertions.
Full-Stack Isolation & Security:
Client applications never access external AI keys directly.
Comprehensive backend REST API with TypeScript schemas, input validation via Zod, and full automated contract/unit test coverage.




